<title>USA: GTECH calls off purchase of NTN.</title>
<headline>GTECH calls off purchase of NTN.</headline>
<dateline>WEST GREENWICH, R.I. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTECH  Holdings Corp said Wednesday that it has terminated its previously announced letter of intent to acquire NTN Communications Inc. The company said the action was taken by mutual agreement.</p>
<p>GTECH said the parties were unable to conclude a definitive agreement and determined to pursue their businesses separately.</p>
<p>GTECH is a provider of computerized on-line lottery products and services.  NTN produces and programs interactive television, and on-line and Internet entertainment.</p>
</text>
